# Turkish genitive suffix -(n)In marking the possessor year in "2020'nin ilk
# yarısı" ("2020's first half"): the tokenizer splits it off the apostrophe as a
# standalone token, so it is bound as the optional connector ``poss`` in the
# year-first half_period order.  TDK, İmla Kılavuzu: ilgi durumu eki -(n)In with
# vowel harmony (nin/nın/nun/nün).  https://sozluk.gov.tr
nin
nın
nun
nün
ın
in
un
ün
